     "matter",
     "mass",
     "particle"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "Matter is anything that has mass and takes up space. A stone, water and even air are matter. Light and sound are not matter.\nMatter is made of tiny particles. In solids they are packed closely, in liquids they are further apart and in gases they are very far apart.\nThis helps explain why solids keep their shape and gases spread."
    }
